  "details": "Currently the SDK doesn't have enough info to direct users in the case of only Clear Cache and PlayerPrefs showing in the SDK. More experienced users will know where to look in these cases but newer users might not have a proper idea how to proceed and where to go look for info. Switching the current links under the Help section to be included inside the DLL where Clear Cache and PlayerPrefs are located so they also show up always would make a difference for a lot of these new users. While also adding a new Link called SDK Troubleshooting that links directly to that section of the docs.\nThis would overall be an easy change to the SDK and would help out a lot users immensely.",
